- Employment: {{ employment_type | replace('_', ' ') | title }}
- Loan Amount: ₹{{ loan_amount | int | format_inr }}
- Tenure Requested: {{ tenure_months }} months
- Credit Score: {{ credit_score }}

## Three Offer Options
{% for offer in offers %}
**{{ offer.option }}:**
- Rate: {{ offer.interest_rate }}% p.a.
- Tenure: {{ offer.tenure_months }} months
- EMI: ₹{{ offer.emi_amount | int | format_inr }} / month
- Total Interest: ₹{{ offer.total_interest | int | format_inr }}
{% endfor %}

## Your Task
Analyse all three offers and provide structured advice for the RM.

Respond with ONLY a JSON object:
```json
{
  "recommended_option": "A|B|C",
  "recommendation_reason": "<2-3 sentences explaining why this option is best for this applicant>",
